  "题目6": "【单项选择】选出最恰当的一项。\n题干：A \"mall rat\" is a young person who ______.\nA. keeps rats\nB. works in a lab\nC. hates shopping\nD. hangs out in malls\n考点：短语",
  "题目7": "【单项选择】选出最恰当的一项。\n题干：In the UK, a mall is often called a shopping ______.\nA. street\nB. bag\nC. centre\nD. list\n考点：用法",
  "答案": "【1】B（购物中心）\n讲解：mall 购物中心。\n【2】A（malls）\n讲解：two 后接复数 malls。\n【3】market\n讲解：farmers' market 农贸市场。\n【4】shop → shops\n讲解：many 后接可数名词复数。\n【5】mall\n讲解：shopping mall 购物中心。\n【6】D（hangs out in malls）\n讲解：mall rat 指整天泡在商场里的年轻人。\n【7】C（centre）\n讲解：英国常说 shopping centre。"
